<title>GUATEMALA: Guatemala July coffee exports 129,559 60-kg bags.</title>
<headline>Guatemala July coffee exports 129,559 60-kg bags.</headline>
<dateline>GUATEMALA CITY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemala exported 129,559 60-kg bags of coffee in July, the National Coffee Association (Anacafe) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exports for the month were 32 percent lower than July 1996 exports of 189,673 60-kg bags, Anacafe president Julio Arrivillaga told Reuters in a faxed statement.  </p>
<p>July exports were 50 percent lower than in June this year, when 257,120 60-kg bags of coffee were exported.</p>
<p>With the harvest over, exports to date for the year total 4.02 million 60-kg bags, including 3,623 bags so far in August, Anacafe said. Last year's exports totalled 3.72 million 60-kg bags.</p>
<p>((--Fiona Ortiz, Guatemala City bureau +502 251-5718))</p>
